---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base>
  <h1>Conquest of Elysium 5 Toolbox</h1>

  <p>
    Browser tools for CoE5 modders — validate your mod files and browse the
    complete command reference, straight from a browser tab. No install, no
    upload.
  </p>

  <p class="privacy-note">Every check runs in your browser tab. Nothing is ever uploaded.</p>

  <div class="cards">
    <a class="card" href="/check">
      <h2>Check a mod</h2>
      <p>
        Paste or drop a <code>.c5m</code> file and get every problem listed
        with its line, an underline, and a hint — the same diagnostics as the
        coe5-modcheck CLI.
      </p>
    </a>
    <a class="card" href="/commands">
      <h2>Command reference</h2>
      <p>
        All 853 mod commands, searchable and filterable — including the 314
        commands the base game never uses and the 3 the manual doesn't
        document.
      </p>
    </a>
  </div>

  <p class="dim more-coming">
    More coming: a playground, an ID browser, and sprite, package and format
    tools are planned.
  </p>
</Base>

<style>
  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .card {
    display: block;
    background: var(--bg-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .card:hover {
    text-decoration: none;
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }

  .card h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--link);
  }

  .card:hover h2 { text-decoration: underline; }

  .card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .more-coming {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
